      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TYPHOON LAD (3) flew the lids from the middle with an impressive turn of foot, going on to clock 22.24 when a 4 length winner over 400m at this track. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in his latest win. Sure to prove hard to beat. LOCKDOWN (6) is better than last start when fourth (29.77) in a NG at Wentworth Park over 520m. Has a strong winning record here at this journey. Form from his last run is proving strong. Likely to be thereabouts. TROPICAL ETHICS (2) goes very well this course and distance starting 13 times for five wins and five minors. Below best last time at this track (23.20) in a Grade 5, finishing a 13 length sixth. With even luck and a clean start should be around the money. DESPICABLE RAMBO (4) picked up a cheque last time and is in the mix again.",
